## 🚦 PHASE COMPLETION CHECKLIST

Before claiming a phase complete, verify ALL of these:

- [ ] All acceptance criteria from plan satisfied
- [ ] All tests written and passing
- [ ] Tested with real Elrace data (not just mock)
- [ ] No technical debt introduced (or it is documented)
- [ ] No deviations from plan (or they are documented and approved)
- [ ] Code documented (docstrings, comments)
- [ ] Type hints on all signatures
- [ ] Error handling for likely failure modes
- [ ] Performance acceptable (< 5s typical response)
- [ ] CURRENT_PHASE.md updated
- [ ] Committed with clear message

