## 🛠️ COMMON COMMANDS

```bash
# Start backend
cd ~/Documents/odoo-projects/ai/odoo_ai_bridge/odoo_ai_bridge
source venv/bin/activate
uvicorn gateway.main:app --reload --port 8000

# Start frontend
cd ~/Documents/odoo-projects/ai/odoo_ai_bridge/ooa-ui
npm start

# Kill backend
lsof -i :8000 | grep Python | awk '{print $2}' | xargs kill -9

# Kill frontend
lsof -i :3000 | grep node | awk '{print $2}' | xargs kill -9

# Run tests
pytest tests/ -v

# Format code
black gateway/ tests/

# Type check
mypy gateway/
```

