## ⚠️ THE GOLDEN RULE

> **If you find yourself making something up because you don't know — STOP and ask M Jawad.**

This applies to:
- Architecture decisions
- Business rules
- API contracts
- User flows
- Error messages
- Data schemas

When in doubt → ask. Better to wait 5 minutes than build the wrong thing for 5 hours.

